From 84b0318d1a21c2065334f9dd6bc29f3d38bc0c4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (review)" <review@localhost>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 09:52:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Stage 3: unconfirmed sell exits never read as flat;
 breaker marked only when confirmed

- verify_sell_filled uses the strict position read; returns None when no read
  confirms the outcome (was: any read error -> 0.0 -> "filled").
- All 6 callers (flatten, emergency hung-stop, scalp trail-breach, time-decay,
  trend trail-breach, trend sell signal): explicit None branch first -> log
  EXIT UNCONFIRMED, write nothing, log no trade; next cycle re-checks.
- flatten_position returns FLAT/PARTIAL/UNCONFIRMED/FAILED; the circuit breaker
  is marked done for the day only on FLAT or PARTIAL (unconfirmed/failed retries).

Tests: stage-3 4 (2 fail + 2 controls pass on 2664dae; 4 pass); tests/ 58 and
P8 103 unchanged (161/161). Buy-fill confirmation deferred to the review gate
(needs a durable pending-entry marker; see STAGE3 review).
